TI  - Formalizing Trust in Artificial Intelligence: Prerequisites, Causes and Goals of Human Trust in AI
AU  - Jacovi, Alon
AU  - Marasovi\'{c}, Ana
AU  - Miller, Tim
AU  - Goldberg, Yoav
PY  - 2021
T2  - Proceedings of the 2021 ACM Conference on Fairness, Accountability, and Transparency
SP  - 624–635
